Test: Optional braces in control flow
--------------------------------------
If/else without braces:
  x is greater than 3 (no braces)
  y is not greater than 3 (no braces)
  z is between 5 and 15 (nested, no braces)
  After if (r < min) min = r, min = 0.5
  a is odd (no braces)
  b is positive
  (braces required for multiple statements)

For loops without braces:
  arr[1] = a
  arr[2] = b
  arr[3] = c

  j = 0
  j = 1
  j = 2

Nested loops without braces:
  x = 0 y = 0
  x = 0 y = 1
  x = 1 y = 0
  x = 1 y = 1

  For-in with assignment, sum = 60

While loops without braces:
  k = 3

  Final count = 3

Do-while loops without braces:
  m = 3

Multiple statements require braces:
  i = 0
  (braces required for multiple statements)
  i = 1
  (braces required for multiple statements)
